---
title: CI/CD Pipeline — GitHub OIDC to AWS
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant OIDC as AWS OIDC Provider
    participant IAM as IAM Role
    participant ECR as Amazon ECR
    participant ECS as Amazon ECS
    participant ALB as ALB
    participant CF as Cloudflare Pages

    Dev->>GH: Push to main
    
    Note over GH: Job: Test
    GH->>GH: pytest tests/ (124 tests)
    
    Note over GH: Job: Build & Deploy
    GH->>OIDC: Present OIDC token
    OIDC->>IAM: Validate repo claim
    IAM-->>GH: Temporary credentials (1hr)
    
    GH->>ECR: Docker login
    GH->>GH: Build sowflow (linux/amd64)
    GH->>ECR: Push sowflow:sha + :latest
    GH->>GH: Build formpilot (linux/amd64)
    GH->>ECR: Push formpilot:sha + :latest
    
    GH->>ECS: update-service sowflow
    GH->>ECS: update-service formpilot
    ECS->>ECR: Pull new images
    ECS->>ALB: Register healthy targets
    GH->>ECS: wait services-stable
    ECS-->>GH: Both services steady state
    
    Note over GH: Job: Deploy Pages (parallel)
    GH->>CF: Deploy landing page
